# Possessor of a Precious Soul - 1 (Q241), played by a level 76 human Gladiator on its level 50
# Sorcerer subclass, every script roll pinned to 0: Talien starts it; Gabrielle and Gilmore send
# the player after Baraham, whose death leaves the Legend of the Seventeen; Kantabilon trades ten
# Malruk Succubus claws for the Echo Crystal; Stedmiel gives the Poetry Book; after a relog the
# subclass is still played; Virgil, Ogmar and Rahorakti send the player after the Splinter
# Stakato's Crimson Moss, which Rahorakti makes into a medicine for Kassandra; Caradine sends the
# player to Noel, who takes the lunargent and hellfire oil, and Caradine closes the quest with
# Virgil's letter; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q241_possessor_of_a_precious_soul.golden
